      "side": 1,
      "message": "Thanks for the comments, I have thought about that! That\u0027s when `stop` command is issued, decrease connection parameter, and when `start` issued, use high connection parameter\n\nThere are 2 possible concerns:\nOne is when update to high connection parameter, it takes time and it may fail. Although there is retry for 5 seconds, but haven\u0027t thoroughly tested yet. \nWeichin suggested that we may need to test if BT controller firmware and hearing aid can work well with frequent connection parameter update.\nSo my possible idea is to let it first work for LE audio, and then possibly do a more thorough testing before let it becomes a general mechanism",
